\chapter{Introduction}
\label{chap:introduction}


Simulating these showers requires sophisticated techniques, with Geant4 \parencite{geant_simul_toolkit} being one of the most commonly employed simulation toolkits.

More recently, Diffusion Models \parencite{Sohl-Dickstein:2015dhe} have also gained significant attention.

In addition, a novel hybrid approach, termed \emph{CaloHit}, is introduced.
